hs) exceeded most earthquakes, exposing the deadly 'adaptation gap' of coastal cities.<br><br><i>Click 3D Earth for full visualization in Google Earth</i>", "x": 0.02, "xanchor": "left", "xref": "paper", "y": 0.02, "yanchor": "bottom", "yref": "paper"}]}}